---
---

<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Let's Talk</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      If you're a founder starting to think about what's next for your
      business, we'd welcome the conversation.
    </p>
    <p class="email-line">
      <a href="mailto:hello@kura.holdings" class="email-link"
        >hello@kura.holdings</a
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .email-line {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .email-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ember);
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .email-link:hover {
    color: var(--ember);
  }
</style>
